    <result xml:space="preserve">As you touch it, the floor beneath you collapses!&#x000A;The apple crumbles to dust!&#x000A;&#x000A;Pit Room&#x000A;You fell into a dark pit. A trap door closed above you.&#x000A;&#x000A;[Your score has just gone down by ten points.]&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
