  <item nodeId="node-400">
    <command xml:space="preserve">help</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">What's happening? Am I disappearing?&#x000A;You hear voice through the wind: Knock on the door!&#x000A;You escaped Lala for now. Find a way out.&#x000A;&#x000A;The Dark Room&#x000A;The room is now illuminated by your torch. On a small golden stool sits a golden apple.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
