    <result xml:space="preserve">Your duck paddles you safely across the river.&#x000A;&#x000A;River Bank (on the giant duck)&#x000A;You reach the other side of the river. The forest feels quieter here.&#x000A;&#x000A;You can see Ivan here.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
