  <item nodeId="node-2190">
    <command xml:space="preserve">cross over</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You step onto the fallen log. It rolls, your foot slips, and icy water closes over your head...&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Here's a summary of your adventure:&#x000A;Rank: Courteous Traveler.&#x000A;Score: 50/100.&#x000A;Food (HP): 0/10.&#x000A;Pet bond: 0/10.&#x000A;Carry: 1kg/6kg (left 5kg).&#x000A;Items carried: gold coin.&#x000A;Time of day: 9:21 am.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;    *** You drown in the raging river. ***&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;In that game you scored 50 out of a possible 100, in 12 turns.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT or UNDO the last command?&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-2191"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-2191">
    <command xml:space="preserve">undo</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Forest River&#x000A;[Previous turn undone.]&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-2192"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-2192">
    <command xml:space="preserve">go west</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Forest Clearing&#x000A;An open clearing. You hear the rush of a nearby river and birds chittering in the canopy.&#x000A;&#x000A;You can see an egg here.&#x000A;&#x000A;You hear distant wingbeats fade away. The forest feels calmer now. Nearby some water and some branches make a melody.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-2193"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-2193">
    <command xml:space="preserve">go south</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Forest&#x000A;You are in a dense forest. You hear a waterfall nearby and voices talking in the distance.&#x000A;&#x000A;A bush heavy with small berries. Some look ripe, some unripe.&#x000A;&#x000A;You can also see ForestDoor and a pink handbag (empty) here.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-2194"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-2194">
    <command xml:space="preserve">go west</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">FlowerValley&#x000A;A vibrant valley bursting with colorful wildflowers stretches before you in every direction. Petals of red, yellow, and purple sway gently in the breeze, filling the air with sweet scents. Amid the blooms, a small furry creature with big curious eyes peeks from behind a daisy cluster-the little animal has found its perfect home here, waiting eagerly for playtime.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-2195"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-2195">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">FlowerValley&#x000A;A vibrant valley bursting with colorful wildflowers stretches before you in every direction. Petals of red, yellow, and purple sway gently in the breeze, filling the air with sweet scents. Amid the blooms, a small furry creature with big curious eyes peeks from behind a daisy cluster-the little animal has found its perfect home here, waiting eagerly for playtime.&#x000A;&#x000A;A giant duck waddles up to you and tilts its head, as if waiting for a name.&#x000A;You can type: name duck as &lt;name&gt;.&#x000A;Tip: you can increase the relationship with your pet.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-2196"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-2196">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ride duck</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You mount the giant duck.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-2197"/>
    </children>
  </item>
