  <item nodeId="node-1862">
    <command xml:space="preserve">cross fallen log</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">That's not something you can enter.&#x000A;&#x000A;You stand there quietly, enjoying the forest, the sound of water and birds.&#x000A;&#x000A;Time seems to pass unnoticed...&#x000A;&#x000A;You realize about ten minutes have passed.&#x000A;Suddenly, the bird flaps its wings and takes off, disappearing into the trees.&#x000A;&#x000A;You chose not to interfere. (+10)&#x000A;[Your score has just gone up by ten points.]&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
