    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-2239">
    <command xml:space="preserve">go north</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Forest Clearing (on the giant duck)&#x000A;An open clearing. You hear the rush of a nearby river and birds chittering in the canopy.&#x000A;&#x000A;You can see a bird here.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
