  <item nodeId="node-1103">
    <command xml:space="preserve">go west</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">FlowerValley&#x000A;A vibrant valley bursting with colorful wildflowers stretches before you in every direction. Petals of red, yellow, and purple sway gently in the breeze, filling the air with sweet scents. Amid the blooms, a small furry creature with big curious eyes peeks from behind a daisy cluster-the little animal has found its perfect home here, waiting eagerly for playtime.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1104"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1104">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">FlowerValley&#x000A;A vibrant valley bursting with colorful wildflowers stretches before you in every direction. Petals of red, yellow, and purple sway gently in the breeze, filling the air with sweet scents. Amid the blooms, a small furry creature with big curious eyes peeks from behind a daisy cluster-the little animal has found its perfect home here, waiting eagerly for playtime.&#x000A;&#x000A;A giant duck waddles up to you and tilts its head, as if waiting for a name.&#x000A;You can type: name duck as &lt;name&gt;.&#x000A;Tip: you can increase the relationship with your pet.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1105"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1105">
    <command xml:space="preserve">name duck as</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">I didn't understand that sentence.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1106"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1106">
    <command xml:space="preserve">name duck as sa</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You name the duck "sa". It seems happy.&#x000A;&#x000A;Voice through the wind: "Try PET DUCK to bond."&#x000A;[Your score has just gone up by twenty points.]&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1107"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1107">
    <command xml:space="preserve">go east</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Forest&#x000A;You are in a dense forest. You hear a waterfall nearby and voices talking in the distance.&#x000A;&#x000A;A bush heavy with small berries. Some look ripe, some unripe.&#x000A;&#x000A;You can also see ForestDoor here.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1108"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1108">
    <command xml:space="preserve">go north</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Forest Clearing&#x000A;An open clearing. You hear the rush of a nearby river and birds chittering in the canopy.&#x000A;&#x000A;You can see a bird here.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1109"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1109">
    <command xml:space="preserve">listen</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You listen quietly, respecting the forest. (+5)&#x000A;[Your score has just gone up by five points.]&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1110"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1110">
    <command xml:space="preserve">examine water</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You watch the water. It flows peacefully.&#x000A;&#x000A;You stand there quietly, enjoying the forest, the sound of water and birds.&#x000A;&#x000A;Time seems to pass unnoticed...&#x000A;&#x000A;You realize about ten minutes have passed.&#x000A;Suddenly, the bird flaps its wings and takes off, disappearing into the trees.&#x000A;&#x000A;You chose not to interfere. (+10)&#x000A;[Your score has just gone up by fifteen points.]&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1111"/>
    </children>
  </item>
