  <item nodeId="node-1125">
    <command xml:space="preserve">pet duck</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You gently pet the giant duck. It seems calmer. (Pet +1)&#x000A;Your duck nudges you gently.&#x000A;&#x000A;You realize you've earned its trust.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;    *** You leave the forest together, wiser and kinder than before. ***&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;In that game you scored 60 out of a possible 100, in 18 turns.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT or UNDO the last command?&#x000A;&gt;</result>
