  <item nodeId="node-1678">
    <command xml:space="preserve">bimbambum</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Here's a summary of your adventure:&#x000A;Rank: Protector of the Nature.&#x000A;Score: 100/100.&#x000A;Food (HP): 10/10.&#x000A;Pet bond: 10/10.&#x000A;Carry: 0kg/6kg (left 6kg).&#x000A;Items carried: nothing.&#x000A;Time of day: 9:00 am.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;    *** Congratulations! You used Lala's favourite word. You just said bim bam bum and bum, finished! Well done! &#x000A;&#x000A;Did you know, the duck is Actually Lala's pet! ***&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;In that game you scored 100 out of a possible 100, in 1 turn.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT or UNDO the last command?&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1679"/>
      <child nodeId="node-1707"/>
    </children>
  </item>
