  <item nodeId="node-1977">
    <command xml:space="preserve">cross over</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You step onto the fallen log. It rolls, your foot slips, and icy water closes over your head...&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Here's a summary of your adventure:&#x000A;Rank: Courteous Traveler.&#x000A;Score: 50/100.&#x000A;Food (HP): 0/10.&#x000A;Pet bond: 9/10.&#x000A;Carry: 1kg/6kg (left 5kg).&#x000A;Items carried: gold coin.&#x000A;Time of day: 9:58 am.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;    *** You drown in the raging river. ***&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;In that game you scored 50 out of a possible 100, in 59 turns.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT or UNDO the last command?&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1978"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1978">
    <command xml:space="preserve">undo</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Forest River&#x000A;[Previous turn undone.]&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1979"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1979">
    <command xml:space="preserve">listen</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You hear nothing unexpected.&#x000A;&#x000A;You stand there quietly, enjoying the forest, the sound of water and birds.&#x000A;&#x000A;Time seems to pass unnoticed...&#x000A;&#x000A;You realize about ten minutes have passed.&#x000A;Suddenly, the bird flaps its wings and takes off, disappearing into the trees.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1980"/>
    </children>
  </item>
