  <item nodeId="node-1807">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Forest&#x000A;You are in a dense forest. You hear a waterfall nearby and voices talking in the distance.&#x000A;&#x000A;A bush heavy with small berries. Some look ripe, some unripe.&#x000A;&#x000A;You can also see ForestDoor here.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
